message: >-
  If you use this software or data, please cite the archived release on Zenodo
  (https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24570714). The software is under the MIT License; the research data, documentation and figures are
  under CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
type: software
title: "CSDIS: Construction Safety Data Intelligence System"
abstract: >-
  Local-first research workbench and data for the study "Mandated but Mismatched? Assessing the
  Alignment Between Smart Construction Safety Technologies and Reported Injury Hazards in Hong Kong
  and Singapore". The release contains the CSDIS software (source collection, evidence review,
  technology-hazard coverage coding and literature screening), the double-coded 148-row 2025
  coverage matrix with its codebook, and the data and scripts for Figure 1 and the PRISMA 2020
  flow diagram (Figure S1).
